"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"domains or ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this tenant’s"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" bounds, and there is no sense in which one tenant’s list of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trusted publishers is stricter than another’s — the same argument [","type":"text"},{"code":"OidcPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes for ","type":"text"},{"code":"dcr_allowed_redirect_hosts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". # Every bound here is a security control","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::max_metadata_bytes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::min_cache_secs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] and [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::max_cache_secs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] are not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tuning knobs. They are, respectively, the ceiling on a read from an attacker-chosen URL, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"floor under how often that read may be repeated, and the ceiling on how long its result may","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be trusted. Each is clamped again in code against the three constants above, so a settings","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row written by hand cannot lift them.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/init(allowHttp:confidentialOnly:enabled:maxCacheSecs:maxMetadataBytes:minCacheSecs:restrictSameDomain:trustedClientIDDomains:trustedRedirectDomains:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/init(from:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializer