SDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/CimdPolicy/maxCacheSecs":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/maxCacheSecs","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"maxCacheSecs","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/cimdpolicy\/maxcachesecs","abstract":[{"text":"The ceiling on a document’s cache lifetime, in seconds. Clamped to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"CIMD_MAX_CACHE_CEILING_SECS","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxCacheSecs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/CimdPolicy/trustedClientIDDomains":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trustedClientIDDomains"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/cimdpolicy\/trustedclientiddomains","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The hosts whose documents this tenant will fetch at all, as globs ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mcp.example.com"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*.example.com"},{"type":"text","text":" for every host under one domain). "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"An empty list resolves nothing","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and enabling CIMD while it is empty is refused — see ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"validate_cimd_policy"},{"type":"text","text":"]. That is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberate departure from “a URL is a client identifier, so any URL will do”: the fetch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is triggered by an unauthenticated request naming the URL, so an unrestricted list is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request-forgery primitive offered to strangers, bounded only by the SSRF guard’s address"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rules. Naming the publishers a tenant actually fronts costs one settings field and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removes the class. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"type":"text","text":" is refused here, and so is a wildcard over a whole top-level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*.com"},{"type":"text","text":"): both are the posture the empty list is refused for, spelled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differently, and a control with no second control behind it cannot have a one-character"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bypass and still be the control. It is a floor and not a public-suffix check —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*.github.io"},{"type":"text","text":" passes, and trusting shared hosting stays the operator’s decision, bounded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the per-tenant quota rather than by this field. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"type":"text","text":" remains valid in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CimdPolicy::trusted_redirect_domains"},{"type":"text","text":"], whose entries are not fetch targets."}],"title":"trustedClientIDDomains","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/trustedClientIDDomains","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/A